<section class="explore-page" id="bookshelf">
  <header class="explore-head"><p class="explore-kicker">YOUR READING SPACE</p><h1>我的阅读书架<span class="accent-dot">.</span></h1><p>把想读的先收好，把读过的慢慢消化。</p></header>
  <div class="explore-note">收藏、学习状态和阅读位置保存在当前浏览器；清除网站数据会移除记录，不会跨设备同步。</div>
  <p id="shelfSummary" class="explore-summary" aria-live="polite"></p>
  <div class="explore-toolbar"><label class="explore-search">查找文章<input id="shelfSearch" type="search" placeholder="输入标题或分类"></label><label>显示<select id="shelfFilter"><option value="all">全部记录</option><option value="saved">我的收藏</option><option value="todo">待学</option><option value="read">已读</option><option value="review">待复习</option><option value="reading">继续阅读</option></select></label></div>
  <div id="shelfList" class="shelf-grid" aria-live="polite"><p>正在读取书架…</p></div>
  <noscript>请启用 JavaScript 查看保存在浏览器里的书架。</noscript>
</section>
